          {
            "title": "Question: Inequality with text values",
            "id": 91828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu sorguda ne yanlış?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" daily\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" destination &lt;&gt; \" /><text value=\"'Paris'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sorguda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">'Paris' gibi metin değerleriyle <code>&lt;&gt;</code> kullanamayız</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her zaman tüm sütunları <code>*</code> ile seçmemiz gerekir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sorguda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir uçuş <code>daily = 2</code> ile <code>'Paris'</code>'e, diğeri <code>daily = 3</code> ile <code>'Rome'</code>'a gidiyor.</p><p>Bu sorgu, bu iki satırdan ne döndürür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" daily\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" destination &lt;&gt; \" /><text value=\"'Paris'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yalnızca 3 daily değeri.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca Rome varış noktası.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">2 ve 3 daily değerleri.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca 2 daily değeri.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yalnızca 3 daily değeri.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Inequality with text values",
            "id": 91833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>WHERE</code> yaz ve <code>destination</code> özelliğinin <code>'Paris'</code> değerine eşit olup olmadığını kontrol eden bir koşul ekle.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE flights (&#xA;destination varchar(255),&#xA;daily int&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO flights (destination, daily)&#xA;VALUES ('New York', 1);&#xA;INSERT INTO flights (destination, daily)&#xA;VALUES ('Paris', 3);&#xA;INSERT INTO flights (destination, daily)&#xA;VALUES ('Hong Kong', 1);&#xA;INSERT INTO flights (destination, daily)&#xA;VALUES ('Rome', 3);\"><tables><table name=\"flights\"><row><header content=\"destination\" /><header content=\"daily\" /></row><row><data content=\"New York\" /><data content=\"1\" /></row><row><data content=\"Paris\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row><row><data content=\"Hong Kong\" /><data content=\"1\" /></row><row><data content=\"Rome\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" destination &lt;&gt; \" /><text value=\"'Paris'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"destination\" /><header content=\"daily\" /></row><row><data content=\"New York\" /><data content=\"1\" /></row><row><data content=\"Hong Kong\" /><data content=\"1\" /></row><row><data content=\"Rome\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>WHERE destination &lt;&gt; 'Paris'</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Greater than operator",
            "id": 91838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi sorgu, <code>games_won</code> değerinin <code>1000</code>'den büyük olduğu öğeleri seçer?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chess_players\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" games_won &lt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chess_players\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" games_won &gt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İkincisi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İlki</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her ikisi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İkincisi öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>SQL'de <code>&lt;</code> küçüktür, <code>&gt;</code> ise büyüktür anlamına gelir.</p><p>Bir oyuncunun tam olarak <code>1000</code> galibiyeti var. Hangi sorgu bu oyuncuyu döndürür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chess_players\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" games_won &lt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chess_players\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" games_won &gt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hiçbiri.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca ilk sorgu.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca ikinci sorgu.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Her iki sorgu da.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hiçbiri.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Less than operator",
            "id": 91836,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>WHERE</code> yaz, ardından <code>games_won</code> değerinin <code>1000</code>'den küçük olup olmadığını kontrol eden bir koşul ekle.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE chess_players (&#xA;name varchar(255),&#xA;games_won int&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO chess_players (name, games_won)&#xA;VALUES ('Carlsen', 1162);&#xA;INSERT INTO chess_players (name, games_won)&#xA;VALUES ('Kasparov', 1370);&#xA;INSERT INTO chess_players (name, games_won)&#xA;VALUES ('Polgár', 692);&#xA;INSERT INTO chess_players (name, games_won)&#xA;VALUES ('Fischer', 546);\"><tables><table name=\"chess_players\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"games_won\" /></row><row><data content=\"Carlsen\" /><data content=\"1162\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kasparov\" /><data content=\"1370\" /></row><row><data content=\"Polgár\" /><data content=\"692\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fischer\" /><data content=\"546\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chess_players\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" games_won &lt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"games_won\" /></row><row><data content=\"Polgár\" /><data content=\"692\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fischer\" /><data content=\"546\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>WHERE games_won &lt; 1000</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: The <= operator",
            "id": 91835,
